<?php foreach($rules as $type=>$items):?><section class="card"><h2><?=ae(['rate'=>'Seasonal rates','discount'=>'Discount rules','fee'=>'Fees'][$type])?></h2><?php if(!$items):?><p class="empty">No rules added yet.</p><?php endif;?><?php foreach($items as $item):?><details><summary><?=ae($item['label'])?> · <?=$item['active']?'Active':'Paused'?> · <?=ae($type==='discount'?$item['family']:($type==='rate'?$item['start_date'].' → '.$item['end_date']:$item['kind']))?></summary><?php form_start('toggle_rule','rates',['type'=>$type,'id'=>$item['id'],'active'=>$item['active']?'0':'1']);?><button class="secondary"><?=$item['active']?'Pause':'Activate'?></button></form><?php form_start($type,'rates',['id'=>$item['id']]);input('label','Name',$item['label'],'text',true,'maxlength="100"');
if($type==='rate'){
    input('start_date','From',$item['start_date'],'date',true);input('end_date','Until (exclusive)',$item['end_date'],'date',true);
